DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260715T120000
UID:6a32b4388d1b82ca9f7a9cb6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Presented by\nYMCA-GTA\,\nthis session will include common fra
 ud and scam methods and how they work. Items such as Pyramid Schemes\, Phi
 shing\, Investment Fraud\, Identity Theft\, and Employment Fraud will be a
 nalyzed. It is a module that teaches participants how to protect themselve
 s from fraud. Vivid victim cases will be discussed in class.\nDrop in\, no
  registration required.
LOCATION:Albion\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a32b4388d1b82ca9f7a9cb6
