BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Hexagon Quilting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T154500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T180000
UID:6a20626f43b41b3d006b6df5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This iconic style of quilting has been documented in textile h
 istory since the late 1700s\, valued both for its geometric beauty and its
  ability to utilize small scraps of fabric efficiently. It is  a classic m
 osaic patchwork style made by piecing together six-sided\, equal-angled ge
 ometric shapes. It makes the perfect pastime\, you can take with you when 
 you are on the go!\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs 
 are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where hel
 pful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered dai
 ly. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out mo
 re.
