SUMMARY:Income\, Expense and Budget
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260819T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260819T120000
UID:6a32b64a7550c8bf9f5dfbbc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Understanding how money flows in and out of your household is 
 the foundation of good financial health.\nPresented by\nYMCA-GTA\,\nthis s
 ession\, we’ll break down different types of income\, common expenses\, 
 and how to create a realistic and effective budget. You’ll learn simple\
 , practical tools to track your finances\, plan for savings\, and avoid co
 mmon budgeting pitfalls. This workshop will help you take control of your 
 money and work toward your financial goals with confidence.\nDrop in\, no 
 registration required.
LOCATION:Albion\, Program will be hosted in the Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a32b64a7550c8bf9f5dfbbc
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
