BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Kimbap Making with Chef Sang Kim
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260819T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260819T170000
UID:6a03618f177319280019325e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Award-winning writer\, chef\, and TV personality\, Sang Kim\, 
 teaches how to make the iconic Korean kimbap\, exactly like you see them o
 n your favorite K-dramas. Participants will prep and utilize ingredients p
 repared by the Chef and eat their own creations.\nAllergen Considerations:
  Includes egg and fishcake (which participants do not have to use). Sesa
 me oil/seeds: Chef Sang will bring the rice without any sesame oil previou
 sly added. Participants can then add it if they wish at the class under hi
 s instructions.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are
