DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260722T180000
UID:6a358f6390cc4e3a790f57ca@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Beat the heat with a summertime flick.  We’re turning our au
 ditorium into a classic drive-in theatre complete with the night sky.\nAre
  we watching an action-packed adventure\, a cheesy rom-com\, or an uproari
 ously funny comedy? Vote for your favourite movie in the Youth Hub. We’l
 l show the film with the most votes.\nThis is a drop-in Youth Hub program 
 for\nteens only.\nNo registration required.\nThis program is part of Youth
  Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and 
 in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritio
 us snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call 
 the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a358f6390cc4e3a790f57ca
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
