DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T180000
UID:6a318bac2ea730c17ab75b3e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Create intricate mosaics by sticking tiny resin diamonds onto 
 an adhesive surface.\nThis is a drop-in program.\nThis program is part of 
 Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school
  and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nut
 ritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor 
 call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Fairview\, In the Barbara Frum Youth Hub on the 3rd floor
