DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T200000
UID:6a32dd6e43b41b3d006f2436@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Public Library is preparing plans to relocate and expa
 nd the St. Lawrence Branch. The new district branch will be at 339 Queen 
 Street East and offer expanded space and services - and we’d like your i
 nput.\nJoin us for a virtual consultation session and for more information
  about this project.\nAt the session\, there will be:\n•	A presentation 
 providing an overview of the St. Lawrence Branch relocation and expansion 
 project\, including key updates\, design considerations and next steps\n
 •	A summary of feedback heard so far through earlier consultations\n•	
 A live Q&A with project staff\n•	Small breakout room discussions to shar
 e feedback and ideas on what you’d like to see in the new space.
